# Cycling demo solution: an arm that delivers repeatedly.
#
# With cycling enabled (see `examples/46_cycling.oml`) the 10-step program
# loops: grab, swing four steps onto the exit, release, swing four steps
# back to the entrance, and repeat.
#
# This is solution.
# The level is defined in `examples/46_cycling.oml`.

# Arm at (3,3); rotation 0 -> hand at (2,4), over the spawned molecule.
place arm 3 3                       # id 4

# One delivery loop.
action 4 1 grab
action 4 2 rotate_clw
action 4 3 rotate_clw
action 4 4 rotate_clw
action 4 5 rotate_clw
action 4 6 release
action 4 7 rotate_cclw
action 4 8 rotate_cclw
action 4 9 rotate_cclw
action 4 10 rotate_cclw
